      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "しちにん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Junior councillors: 7 persons. The count glyph was zoomed to a single character at 7x: it is 七 (vertical crossed by a rising horizontal, bottom bending right into a hook), not 六 (which would carry the 亠 lid) and not 九. Only six junior councillors are named on this leaf — 吉田博文, 有馬重國, 西原湊, 圓岡成與, 木村三郎, 岡田彈右衞門 — and no seventh name is printed anywhere against this heading. The shortfall sits in the source, not in the reading."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "久留米少參事人數"
      }
